Brimoraks are devils that carry a flaming sword and work fire. One breathes out its own burning blood in a line that knocks people from their feet. The ball of flame it called down burst over the Party and left it untouched.

A brimorak fought beside two [[Bestiary/Barbazu|Barbazu]] in the trial by combat at the [[Geography/Calaria/Ragged Roost|Ragged Roost]] pilgrimage. Its sword and its blood put two of the Party on the ground before Benny's pick killed it.
